This is a fish-eye-lens security camera.
They can provide 180-360 degrees of view. This effectively reduces the occurrence of blind spots, providing increased security. Because of they have a domed body and
are fitted with the flat side on walls, this type of security camera is tamper proof. Tamper proofing security cameras is important to ensure their continued usefulness,
ensuring they cannot be taken offline by criminals. They can also be fitted with infrared radiation, night vision capabilities to provide continued security at night,
which provides around the clock security.

